# Phase 8B Implementation Plan: Precise Database Connectors

This phase matures the database ingestion layer by introducing **SQLAlchemy** for unified connection handling and establishing an API contract for full connection parameters (Host, Port, Credentials). This replaces the preliminary environment-based config with a proper session-driven configuration flow.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **API Change**: I will introduce a new endpoint `POST /session/{session_id}/connection` allowing the UI (or API consumer) to inject specific database credentials for a session. This is more scalable than environment variables.
>
> **Extraction Strategy**: Per instructions, we will switch to `SELECT * FROM table_name`, loading the entire table into a pandas DataFrame before normalization. This ensures maximum compatibility but relies on the table being a reasonable size for memory.

